            "description": "No player token: Monster Raid Service checks raid joiners' membership as itself. The gateway passes X-Service-Key on and adds its own key; Guild Service accepts Monster Raid's key on this one endpoint. Set monsterRaidServiceKey to SERVICE_KEY_MONSTER_RAID from .env."
